---
// "Skip to content": the first focusable element on the page (STRUCTURE.md "Global chrome").
---
<a class="skip" href="#content">Skip to content</a>

<style is:global>
  .skip {
    position: fixed;
    top: 8px;
    left: 8px;
    z-index: 100;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--night);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transform: translateY(calc(-100% - 16px));
  }
  .skip:focus-visible {
    transform: none;
  }
</style>
